error[RB0116]: `uploads` holds `upload` tasks, which take no events: it cannot be sent `Pause`
  --> RB0116-send-to-task.road:11:32
   |
11 |     on Pause send uploads["a"].Pause  send uploads.*.Pause
   |                                ^^^^^
   |
   = help: a task only emits, as `on uploads.Event`; host code decides how it reacts, so pass what it needs as an argument when it starts

